{"id": "instruction_14", "type": "instruction", "text": "<p><b>How you respond in this version.</b> Instead of clicking on the response grid, you will use <b>sliders</b>: an <b>x</b> slider (0 = left, 100 = right) and a <b>y</b> slider (0 = bottom, 100 = top) to indicate which corner the speaker means (and, on the final trial, the speaker's blind spot). A separate slider records how <b>wordy</b> the speaker is.</p>"}
{"id": "comprehension_quiz_01", "type": "comprehension_quiz", "text": "<p>Please answer the following questions carefully.</p>", "queries": [{"prompt": "You will...", "type": "multi-choice", "tag": "quiz_q1", "option": ["give instructions to a virtual partner.", "follow the instructions of a virtual partner."], "answer": 1, "required": true}, {"prompt": "My virtual partner...", "type": "multi-choice", "tag": "quiz_q2", "option": ["sees all four corners.", "sees only three corners."], "answer": 1, "required": true}, {"prompt": "My virtual partner's blind spot...", "type": "multi-choice", "tag": "quiz_q3", "option": ["is the same in all trials.", "is different in each trial."], "answer": 0, "required": true}, {"prompt": "My virtual partner...", "type": "multi-choice", "tag": "quiz_q4", "option": ["knows that he has a blind spot.", "does not know about his blind spot."], "answer": 1, "required": true}, {"prompt": "My virtual partner...", "type": "multi-choice", "tag": "quiz_q5", "option": ["is always trying to be helpful.", "will sometimes mislead me on purpose."], "answer": 0, "required": true}, {"prompt": "I will figure out what my virtual partner can see by...", "type": "multi-choice", "tag": "quiz_q6", "option": ["looking at all four figures.", "looking at what the virtual partner says.", "looking at both."], "answer": 2, "required": true}, {"prompt": "What does the x slider represent?", "type": "multi-choice", "tag": "quiz_q7", "option": ["0 is left and 100 is right", "0 is bottom and 100 is top", "It measures certainty only"], "answer": 0, "required": true}, {"prompt": "On which trial will you also judge the blind spot?", "type": "multi-choice", "tag": "quiz_q8", "option": ["Trial 1", "Trial 3", "Trial 5"], "answer": 2, "required": true}]}
